## Walk group super-nodes on Find Path

Context: Collapsed groups rewrite instance edges onto super-nodes. Find Path
skipped those nodes and missed inbound directed edges, so paths vanished
once a group was expanded or left collapsed. Maximum hops was also
redundant (canvas-only search). Find path (To) no longer needs a dialog.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/js/query-find-path.js
   BFS uses inbound+outbound neighbours and traverses group/cluster
   super-nodes; resolveDisplayedNodeId maps a collapsed member URI to its
   super-node. Find path (To) calls _runDirect with no modal. Hop cap removed.
2. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js
   Filter anchor resolves through super-node membership.
3. src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_sigmagraph.html
   Remove Maximum hops from the Find Path modal.
